WEBVTT

1
00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:40.500
Lord Krishna concluded the sixth chapter

2
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.875
by clarifying that the person who
 constantly meditates on him 

3
00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:46.750
is the supreme yogi.

4
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.333
Now in this chapter,

5
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:53.916
Lord Krishna will explain
 to us how this level can be reached.

6
00:00:53.916 --> 00:01:00.625
From the second chapter to the sixth
 chapter of the Bhagavad Gita,

7
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:04.250
Lord Krishna explained many important 
things through a sequential process.

8
00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.500
First, according to the knowledge
 of Sāṅkhya yoga,

9
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:13.458
we learned that our existence
 is a soul, not body.

10
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:16.500
We understood our position in this world.

11
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.125
Then we understood the depth
 of nişkāma karma yoga,

12
00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:24.166
and then at the end of the sixth chapter,

13
00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:28.375
we understood that being completely absorbed

14
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:31.583
in meditation on Lord Krishna is the
 supreme state of dhyāna yoga.

15
00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:34.166
Now from this seventh chapter,

16
00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:37.583
Krishna explains such a direct and clear path

17
00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:41.666
by which we can completely
 engage our mind in Him.

18
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:42.958
And Krishna begins this

19
00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:45.416
by explaining how

20
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:49.000
His constant meditation can be done.

21
00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:56.750
In this verse, Lord Krishna says,

22
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.250
O Pārtha, listen carefully

23
00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.833
how you, by engaging your mind in me,

24
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:07.000
taking my shelter, and being firm in bhakti yoga,

25
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:12.000
can know me completely without any doubt.

26
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.916
This verse is extremely beautiful

27
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:15.750
because in this one verse alone

28
00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:20.625
there's description of all the
 stages of attaining Lord Krishna.

29
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:23.416
First stage: "Tat śrņu,"

30
00:02:23.416 --> 00:02:26.833
meaning hearing or listening.

31
00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:30.291
Krishna says, "Listen to my words carefully."

32
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:36.250
This is the first stage, meaning we must
 regularly listen to Krishna's teaching,

33
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:41.208
must understand the knowledge
 and guidance given by Him.

34
00:02:41.208 --> 00:02:45.041
Second stage: "Jñāsyasi samagram,"

35
00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:48.958
meaning understanding completely.

36
00:02:48.958 --> 00:02:50.666
By hearing about Krishna, we start
 understanding his divine form,

37
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:53.458
we start understanding his divine form,

38
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:58.833
His relationship with this world, and His reality.

39
00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:01.416
Third stage: "Asaṁśayaṁ,"

40
00:03:01.416 --> 00:03:04.875
meaning freedom from doubt.

41
00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:08.000
When we listen to Lord Krishna's
 deep knowledge,

42
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.875
understand it, then our doubts
 start disappearing.

43
00:03:11.875 --> 00:03:14.375
And as these doubts disappear,

44
00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:16.500
we move toward Lord Krishna

45
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.625
with mind and action with more faith.

46
00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:24.458
Fourth stage: "Āśrayaḥ,"

47
00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:28.125
meaning taking Krishna's shelter.

48
00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:30.000
When we understand Krishna,

49
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.583
then we know that there's no one else like Him

50
00:03:33.583 --> 00:03:36.833
as a supreme friend, well-wisher,

51
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:38.666
thinking of our welfare.

52
00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:41.125
In such a case, we become desirous

53
00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:44.666
of His shelter with love and devotion.

54
00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:46.750
Fifth stage:

55
00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.041
"Yogaṁ yuñjan,"

56
00:03:49.041 --> 00:03:52.250
meaning practice of yoga of service.

57
00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.416
After taking Krishna's shelter,

58
00:03:54.416 --> 00:03:58.833
now our surrender manifests in our activities.

59
00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:03.083
We connect our life with Krishna's teachings

60
00:04:03.083 --> 00:04:08.041
through yoga of service, 
prayer, and meditation.

61
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:12.833
Sixth and final stage: "Āsakta-manaḥ,"

62
00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:16.166
meaning attachment in Krishna.

63
00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:20.416
While doing service surrendered
 to him in Krishna's shelter,

64
00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:23.916
we become merged in Krishna
 with mind and emotion.

65
00:04:23.916 --> 00:04:27.083
Our thoughts, desires, and emotions,

66
00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:30.166
all start getting inspired toward Krishna,

67
00:04:30.166 --> 00:04:35.041
and we experience
 unprecedented bliss of divine love.

68
00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:38.416
Thus, in this verse, Krishna explains

69
00:04:38.416 --> 00:04:40.500
how we, by listening,

70
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.708
understanding, removing all our doubts,

71
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:46.708
attain Krishna's shelter.

72
00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:56.250
In Arjuna's mind there are many doubts –

73
00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.416
regarding this war,

74
00:04:58.416 --> 00:05:01.416
regarding sin and merit,

75
00:05:01.416 --> 00:05:05.208
regarding his duty.

76
00:05:05.208 --> 00:05:08.250
And therefore I am telling him

77
00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:12.666
to listen to and understand 
these things carefully

78
00:05:12.666 --> 00:05:15.375
so that all his suspicions,

79
00:05:15.375 --> 00:05:19.625
all doubts are removed.

80
00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:23.916
When you move forward on any path of life,

81
00:05:23.916 --> 00:05:27.750
especially on the spiritual path,

82
00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:33.208
clouds of doubt and confusion 
gathering is natural.

83
00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:35.000
When even after walking some distance

84
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.833
the destination isn't visible,

85
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:43.666
then this doubt can also awaken in the mind

86
00:05:43.666 --> 00:05:47.750
that perhaps you've come on the wrong path.

87
00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.875
In such a circumstance, there's a simple

88
00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:54.541
and effective remedy.

89
00:05:54.541 --> 00:05:55.875
Never stop listening to knowledge 

90
00:05:55.875 --> 00:06:01.375
from trusted and right sources.

91
00:06:01.375 --> 00:06:05.208
Like this Bhagavad Gita,

92
00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:12.125
or someone who has already
 walked on this spiritual path.

93
00:06:12.125 --> 00:06:18.791
This will remove your doubt and 
will be helpful in you and your progress.

94
00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:23.458
And this remedy isn't limited
 only to spiritual life;

95
00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:27.000
it applies in every field of life.

96
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.208
If you’re confused about your
 professional responsibilities,

97
00:06:30.208 --> 00:06:32.000
personal relationships,

98
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:36.000
or life goals,

99
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.500
then consult with the right people –

100
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.125
some experienced guide,

101
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:45.083
or some trustworthy friend or guru.

102
00:06:45.083 --> 00:06:48.041
When you listen to the right people's words

103
00:06:48.041 --> 00:06:50.791
and adopt their experience,

104
00:06:50.791 --> 00:06:53.666
then your doubts are removed

105
00:06:53.666 --> 00:06:57.500
and self-confidence awakens in you.

106
00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.500
And for walking on any personal journey,

107
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:05.625
self-confidence is most important.

108
00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:07.916
And yes,

109
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:10.041
never consider doubt

110
00:07:10.041 --> 00:07:15.666
or suspicion arising in the mind as your weakness.

111
00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:17.916
This is very natural.

112
00:07:17.916 --> 00:07:18.916
In every progressive

113
00:07:18.916 --> 00:07:21.750
person's mind, doubts awaken.

114
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.708
The difference is only this –

115
00:07:24.708 --> 00:07:28.041
that person, by listening to and understanding

116
00:07:28.041 --> 00:07:31.666
right knowledge, removes these doubts

117
00:07:31.666 --> 00:07:34.791
and then moves forward firmly.

118
00:07:34.791 --> 00:07:37.833
You too move forward.

119
00:07:42.708 --> 00:07:47.875
You also know that when in this verse

120
00:07:47.875 --> 00:07:52.000
I'm telling Arjuna to listen,

121
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.000
its meaning is not only from hearing my words,

122
00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:02.375
but also from grasping their meaning.

123
00:08:02.375 --> 00:08:05.041
In family and social settings,

124
00:08:05.041 --> 00:08:09.625
many times we do listen to others' words,

125
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:14.458
but only for the purpose of replying,

126
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:19.541
for the purpose of making our point heard.

127
00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:23.250
The real meaning of listening to someone's words

128
00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:27.083
is understanding their perspective.

129
00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:29.000
And this lesson

130
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:33.791
will be extremely useful in family settings.

131
00:08:33.791 --> 00:08:37.416
In the family, many people live together.

132
00:08:37.416 --> 00:08:42.750
Everyone has their own experiences,
 emotions, and perspectives.

133
00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.125
In such a case, misunderstandings

134
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:48.416
arising is natural,

135
00:08:48.416 --> 00:08:51.083
and many times this also

136
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:55.041
becomes the cause of mutual discord.

137
00:08:55.041 --> 00:08:58.791
The simplest and most effective remedy

138
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:02.291
to remove these misunderstandings is –

139
00:09:02.291 --> 00:09:07.500
listening to the other
 with patience and devotion.

140
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:11.666
When we listen to each other
 with the feeling of understanding,

141
00:09:11.666 --> 00:09:15.250
only then can we understand their perspective,

142
00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.083
and then slowly many times

143
00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:21.458
it becomes known that perhaps both family

144
00:09:21.458 --> 00:09:26.000
members' purpose was the same,

145
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.375
only the way of thinking

146
00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:31.000
was different.

147
00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.166
And when the purpose is one,

148
00:09:34.166 --> 00:09:39.750
then doubt starts disappearing automatically.

149
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:43.000
In the family, listening to each other

150
00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.916
is also respecting each other.

151
00:09:46.916 --> 00:09:49.250
And where there's respect,

152
00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.583
relationships also become strong.

153
00:09:53.583 --> 00:09:55.625
The importance of listening

154
00:09:55.625 --> 00:09:58.125
and grasping carefully

155
00:09:58.125 --> 00:10:02.083
is also in spiritual life.

156
00:10:02.083 --> 00:10:06.541
In the path of spiritual life too, it's possible

157
00:10:06.541 --> 00:10:11.708
some wrong notion or fear sits in our mind.

158
00:10:11.708 --> 00:10:14.666
In such a case, taking guidance

159
00:10:14.666 --> 00:10:17.291
from some experienced guru

160
00:10:17.291 --> 00:10:20.208
will be extremely helpful, because

161
00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:23.666
they know both the cause of these doubts

162
00:10:23.666 --> 00:10:26.583
and the solution.

163
00:10:26.583 --> 00:10:28.375
The Bhagavad Gita

164
00:10:28.375 --> 00:10:30.625
also knows all your doubts

165
00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:34.583
and their solutions.

166
00:10:34.583 --> 00:10:37.000
Listen patiently,

167
00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.208
not to answer,

168
00:10:39.208 --> 00:10:43.833
but to understand others' perspective.

169
00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:52.333
It's necessary for Arjuna

170
00:10:52.333 --> 00:10:55.416
that by listening and understanding,

171
00:10:55.416 --> 00:11:00.250
he removes all his doubts.

172
00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.541
In professional life too,

173
00:11:02.541 --> 00:11:07.041
many types of doubts arise.

174
00:11:07.041 --> 00:11:09.416
This often happens

175
00:11:09.416 --> 00:11:16.375
when we're uncertain about some
 work, process, or plan.

176
00:11:16.375 --> 00:11:18.541
We don't have confidence

177
00:11:18.541 --> 00:11:23.333
whether we're going in the right direction or not.

178
00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:26.458
This is a very common feeling,

179
00:11:26.458 --> 00:11:31.958
but finding its solution is extremely important.

180
00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:39.458
Because even a small straw of distrust,

181
00:11:39.458 --> 00:11:42.166
if not removed, can cause great harm.

182
00:11:42.166 --> 00:11:46.708
The best remedy to remove this doubt is

183
00:11:46.708 --> 00:11:50.833
asking appropriate questions 
from appropriate people.

184
00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:53.458
These appropriate people are those

185
00:11:53.458 --> 00:11:56.083
who have experience in that field,

186
00:11:56.083 --> 00:11:57.791
who are your well-wishers,

187
00:11:57.791 --> 00:12:03.041
or whose purpose is also the progress

188
00:12:03.041 --> 00:12:05.875
of that organization where you work.

189
00:12:05.875 --> 00:12:07.875
But many times a person

190
00:12:07.875 --> 00:12:10.833
is afraid to ask questions.

191
00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:15.500
They feel people will mock them,

192
00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.000
will doubt their capability.

193
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.500
But remember,

194
00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.625
better than stopping your progress

195
00:12:24.625 --> 00:12:28.166
due to ambiguity and distrust

196
00:12:28.166 --> 00:12:31.375
is to ask questions

197
00:12:31.375 --> 00:12:35.208
and move forward with complete thought and vision.

198
00:12:35.208 --> 00:12:37.625
When you ask the right questions,

199
00:12:37.625 --> 00:12:42.666
take consultation, and grasp right knowledge,

200
00:12:42.666 --> 00:12:46.458
then not only are your doubts removed,

201
00:12:46.458 --> 00:12:50.875
but your self-confidence also increases.

202
00:12:50.875 --> 00:12:53.291
This is necessary for progress

203
00:12:53.291 --> 00:12:57.166
in both professional and spiritual life.
